{"id":"79374490721c4e4f","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-admissible-rule-extension.md","title":"可采纳规则与不增加定理的扩充","display":"thm-admissible-rule-extension — 可采纳规则与不增加定理的扩充","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-admissible-rule-extension","aliases":["72-thm-admissible-rule-extension"],"display":"thm-admissible-rule-extension — 可采纳规则与不增加定理的扩充","depends_on":["[[72-df-rule-admissibility]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I cut-admissibility/cut-elimination discussion §2.4; local complete finite-tree argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-admissible-rule-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-admissible-rule-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-admissible-rule-extension — 可采纳规则与不增加定理的扩充"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cb3f50bafebb1dd5\" href=\"?note=cb3f50bafebb1dd5\" title=\"72-df-rule-admissibility\">72-df-rule-admissibility</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I cut-admissibility/cut-elimination discussion §2.4; local complete finite-tree argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal U,D_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal U,D_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cb3f50bafebb1dd5\" href=\"?note=cb3f50bafebb1dd5\" title=\"72-df-rule-admissibility\">72-df-rule-admissibility</a>；演算加规则的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 保持同一判断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad D_{\\mathcal C+\\mathcal U}=D_{\\mathcal C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad D_{\\mathcal C+\\mathcal U}=D_{\\mathcal C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向右对扩充演算的有限证明树归纳：旧规则可把各个已有 C 证明接成一棵 C 证明，新规则用可采纳性。旧演算的证明亦是扩充证明，得到另一包含。向左，任一新规则的有限多个前提若各有 C 证明，就可在扩充演算内将这些证明接到该规则下；结论属于扩充定理集，假定的相等使其属于 C。有限元数保证接合树仍有限。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-rule-admissibility","status":"resolved","id":"cb3f50bafebb1dd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-rule-admissibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-rule-admissibility","status":"resolved","id":"cb3f50bafebb1dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C,\\mathcal U,D_{\\mathcal C}$ 沿用 [[72-df-rule-admissibility]]；演算加规则的 $+$ 保持同一判断集合 $Q$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal U,D_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adm}_{\\mathcal C}(\\mathcal U)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad D_{\\mathcal C+\\mathcal U}=D_{\\mathcal C}.","display":true}],"bytes":1527,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72